description\" class=\"inactive eael-tab-item-trigger eael-tab-nav-item\" aria-selected=\"true\" data-tab=\"1\" role=\"tab\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-controls=\"application-description-tab\" aria-expanded=\"false\">\n                            \n                            \n                            \n                                                            <span class=\"eael-tab-title title-after-icon\" >Application description<\/span>                                                    <\/li>\n                                            <li id=\"ft-ir-spectroscopy\" class=\"inactive eael-tab-item-trigger eael-tab-nav-item\" aria-selected=\"false\" data-tab=\"2\" role=\"tab\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-controls=\"ft-ir-spectroscopy-tab\" aria-expanded=\"false\">\n                            \n                            \n                            \n                                                            <span class=\"eael-tab-title title-after-icon\" >FT-IR spectroscopy<\/span>                                                    <\/li>\n                                            <li id=\"raman-spectroscopy\" class=\"inactive eael-tab-item-trigger eael-tab-nav-item\" aria-selected=\"false\" data-tab=\"3\" role=\"tab\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-controls=\"raman-spectroscopy-tab\" aria-expanded=\"false\">\n                            \n                            \n                            \n                                                            <span class=\"eael-tab-title title-after-icon\" >Raman spectroscopy<\/span>                                                    <\/li>\n                                    <\/ul>\n            <\/div>\n            \n            <div class=\"eael-tabs-content\">\n\t\t        \n                    <div id=\"application-description-tab\" class=\"clearfix eael-tab-content-item inactive\" data-title-link=\"application-description-tab\">\n\t\t\t\t        <p>Since 2002, the US CDC has also recommended alcohol-based products for hand disinfection: <strong>isopropanol, ethanol, n-propanol<\/strong>, or a combination of two. The antimicrobial activity of these alcohols is attributed to their ability to denature proteins. The best antimicrobial efficacy can be achieved with ethanol (60 to 85%) and isopropanol (60 to 80%), but higher concentrations are less effective because proteins are not so easily denatured in the absence of water.<\/p>\n<figure id=\"attachment_9227\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-9227\" style=\"width: 666px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-9227\" src=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2021\/10\/5570b7ff-300x157.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"666\" height=\"348\" srcset=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2021\/10\/5570b7ff-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2021\/10\/5570b7ff-1024x535.png 1024w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2021\/10\/5570b7ff-768x401.png 768w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2021\/10\/5570b7ff-1536x802.png 1536w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2021\/10\/5570b7ff-2048x1070.png 2048w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 666px) 100vw, 666px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-9227\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Method (created in the TQ Analyst program) for calculating the amount of methanol and isopropanol in the measured sample<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p>In <a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/en\/control-and-analysis-of-hand-sanitizers\/\">response to the Covid-19 pandemic<\/a>, a number of countries have allowed the temporary use of unapproved disinfectants, which has not only provided new opportunities for their suppliers, but also posed new challenges in the form of the need for <strong>reliable production control<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p>Because it is necessary to ensure fluency and disrupt as few processes as possible during production, it is suitable to take advantage of the properties of molecular spectroscopy: the speed of measurement and the need for <strong>no or minimal sample treatment<\/strong>. When using the <strong>ATR<\/strong>technique, all you have to do is apply a small amount of sample to the crystal and you will get an easily interpretable spectrum in a few seconds.<\/p>\n<p><strong><u>Intelligent software<\/u><\/strong><\/p>\n<p>The trouble-free operation of FT-IR spectrometers is ensured by the <a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/en\/application-support\/software\/omnic-9\/\">OMNIC<\/a> control program. In the case of the Nicolet Summit device, it is the OMNIC Paradigm, in which it is possible to easily create workflows that will make your work even easier.<\/p>\n<figure id=\"attachment_9229\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-9229\" style=\"width: 666px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-9229\" src=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2021\/10\/b5175dbf-300x102.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"666\" height=\"225\" srcset=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2021\/10\/b5175dbf-300x102.png 300w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2021\/10\/b5175dbf-1024x347.png 1024w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2021\/10\/b5175dbf-768x260.png 768w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2021\/10\/b5175dbf-1536x520.png 1536w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2021\/10\/b5175dbf-2048x693.png 2048w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 666px) 100vw, 666px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-9229\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Workflow diagram created in the OMNIC Paradigm program<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p>In addition, it is possible to develop customized calibration methods in the <a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/en\/application-support\/software\/tq-analyst-9\/\">TQ Analyst<\/a> program, so you will get not only the spectrum of the sample, but also the data on the concentrations of the monitored substances in a few moments.<\/p>\n                    <\/div>\n\t\t        \n                    <div id=\"ft-ir-spectroscopy-tab\" class=\"clearfix eael-tab-content-item inactive\" d